#: components/Homepage.vue:53
msgid "@homepage/howitworks"
msgstr ""
"<h2>How it works?</h2>\n"
"<p>\n"
"  In old times we bought newspapers every day. Each issue of newspaper was "
"prepared by professional editors who selected the\n"
"  best articles from professional authors. By buying a newspaper, you pay "
"those editors and authors.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"  In modern world of social media we lost professional editors and authors "
"are dependent on advertisement.\n"
"  Now it's your friends who are selecting the content in your timeline. The "
"result is not good.\n"
"  Exceptional journalism depends on professional editors and authors, who "
"will get paid fairly.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"  In Kairly readers are subscribing newspapers and paying for them.\n"
"  Those money are then shared between editors and authors.\n"
"</p>"

#: components/Homepage.vue:79
msgid "@homepage/whatwebelievein"
msgstr ""
"<h2>What we believe in?</h2>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"  In the world full of fake news, manipulations and attacks on journalism, "
"we stand for <strong>truth</strong>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>In the world full of censorship and propaganda, we stand for <strong>free "
"speech</strong>.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"  In the world full of distraction and lack of focus, we stand for\n"
"  <strong>control of your time and undistracted reading experience</"
"strong>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>\n"
"  In the world where journalist are dependent on advertisement or big "
"corporations with their interests,\n"
"  we stand for <strong>fair reward for high-quality content</strong>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Stand with us!</p>"

